                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/releases/tag/10.0.101"&gt;10.0.101&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;.NET MAUI 10.0.101 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;.NET MAUI 10.0.101 introduces significant improvements across all platforms with focus on quality, performance, and developer experience. This release includes 17 commits with various improvements, bug fixes, and enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Button&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[release/10.0.1xx-sr10] Preserve custom iOS button styling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kubaflo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kubaflo"&gt;@kubaflo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5218443677" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37726" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37726/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37726"&gt;#37726&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;🔧 Fixes&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/36749" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/issues/36749/hovercard"&gt;[iOS] ButtonHandler now clears platform-view styling set by custom handlers when Button.Background/TextColor are null (regression in 10.0.80)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Drawing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/10.0.1xx-sr10] Update SkiaSharp to 4.150.1 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kubaflo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kubaflo"&gt;@kubaflo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5218445090" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37731" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37731/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37731"&gt;#37731&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Essentials&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[release/10.0.1xx-sr10] Fix MediaPicker completion from child activities by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kubaflo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kubaflo"&gt;@kubaflo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5218443074" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37724" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37724/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37724"&gt;#37724&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;🔧 Fixes&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/35826" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/issues/35826/hovercard"&gt;MediaPicker - PickPhotosAsync doesn't return on Android when using multiple Activities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[10.0.101] Fix the SR10 test failures by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TamilarasanSF4853/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TamilarasanSF4853"&gt;@TamilarasanSF4853&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5278672747" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37949" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37949/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37949"&gt;#37949&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Layout&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[release/10.0.1xx-sr10] Fix dynamic ContentPresenter assignment by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kubaflo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kubaflo"&gt;@kubaflo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5218443399" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37725" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37725/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37725"&gt;#37725&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
