&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37706" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/issues/37706/hovercard"&gt;[Android] Page.OnBackButtonPressed() is no longer invoked after upgrading to Microsoft.Maui.Controls 10.0.100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;SafeArea&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[release/10.0.1xx-sr10] Fix per-edge iOS safe area handling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kubaflo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kubaflo"&gt;@kubaflo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5218444278" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/37728" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/37728/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/37728"&gt;#37728&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
