&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/issues/34563" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/issues/34563/hovercard"&gt;[iOS] Vertical &lt;code&gt;SafeAreEdge&lt;/code&gt; isn't respected when &lt;code&gt;Top&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Bottom&lt;/code&gt; constraints mismatch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
